#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:1
msgid "AWS China Activate credits"
msgstr "亚马逊云科技中国区Activate积分"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:4
msgid "Cloud credits | Citywide / global"
msgstr "云积分｜全市／全球"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:6
msgid "Regional eligibility to confirm"
msgstr "地区资格待确认"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S042 <https://www.amazonaws.cn/en/activate/>`_. Amazon Web "
"Services Activate-Amazon Web Services China Region."
msgstr "`证据 S042 <https://www.amazonaws.cn/en/activate/>`_. Amazon Web Services Activate-Amazon Web Services China Region."

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:13
msgid "Package-specific promotional credits for eligible China services"
msgstr "依支持包抵扣合资格中国区云服务"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:15
msgid "No equity stated in offer; verify terms"
msgstr "所述方案无股权要求，须核验协议"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:20
msgid ""
"China-established unlisted startup and qualifying new-customer / "
"participating partner relationship. Do not substitute global AWS account "
"rules or credit ceilings."
msgstr "在中国设立的非上市初创企业，符合新客户及合作伙伴关系要求；不能套用全球AWS账户规则或额度。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:22
msgid "Confirm current package and expiration"
msgstr "确认现行支持包及到期"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://www.amazonaws.cn/en/activate/>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://www.amazonaws.cn/en/activate/>`_"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:33
msgid ""
"Check incorporation, company age, account region and existing benefits."
msgstr "核验注册、企业年限、账户地区及已有权益。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:35
msgid "Apply through the official program form or qualifying partner route."
msgstr "通过官方表格或合资格合作方路径申请。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:37
msgid ""
"Confirm covered services, expiry, fees, usage limits and overage billing."
msgstr "确认支持服务、到期、费用、用量限制及超额计费。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:39
msgid "Keep usage records and do not describe credits as unrestricted cash."
msgstr "保留使用记录，不把积分视为自由现金。"

#: ../../funding/aws-credit.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
